  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Pivot-chord modulation uses:\n\n- A) Chord belonging to both old and new keys\n- B) Silence only\n- C) Tempo change only\n- D) Random accidentals\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Modulation establishes new tonic; tonicisation is brief.\n\n**Answer:** True",
